OL,3,ASydney Marathon medal mistakenly
OL,4,Adepicts Munich stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne week out from the world-renowned
OL,7,FSydney Marathon, organisers face
OL,8,Fquestions about whether designers
OL,9,Fetched the wrong city's stadium on the
OL,10,Fparticipation medal.
OL,12,FThe medal appears to feature a stadium
OL,13,Fcarved in the likeness of Allianz Arena
OL,14,Fin the German city of Munich, rather
OL,15,Fthan Allianz Stadium in Sydney ` which
OL,16,Fthe 42.2km (26.2 mile) course runs
OL,17,Fpast.
OL,19,FThe BBC has reached out to Sydney
OL,20,FMarathon for comment.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
