OL,3,ASydney Marathon medal mistakenly
OL,4,Adepicts Munich stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 40,000 runners will be taking part
OL,7,Fin the event on 30 August, after more
OL,8,Fthan 120,000 ballot entries.
